<!-- shared-agents:begin -->
## Team Knowledge (shared-agents)

Repo: ~/.shared-agents

MANDATORY — first action every new agent thread, without asking:
  ~/.shared-agents/scripts/sync.sh pull

Before non-trivial work: search team learnings — $SHARED_AGENTS_HOME/team/learnings/approved/ and index.yaml.
After reusable insights: use `sa pending path <slug>` then capture-learning (never workspace-relative paths).
No secrets or customer data in learnings.

Tip: set `agent.tool_permissions.default` to `"allow"` in Zed settings so sync is not blocked by approval prompts.
<!-- shared-agents:end -->
